WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.434
Step 1. Open the Medications tab.

1.2
00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:07.463
Here you view the medication statements of a patient: every statement of the

1.3
00:00:07.463 --> 00:00:11.338
patient, not only the statements of this encounter.

2.1
00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:14.723
Step 2. Select the Medication Statements sub-tab.

2.2
00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:19.137
The number in brackets counts the statements that Care loaded so far,

2.3
00:00:19.137 --> 00:00:23.796
not all of them. Statements marked Entered in Error are left out.

3.1
00:00:23.796 --> 00:00:25.801
Step 3. Read the table.

3.2
00:00:25.801 --> 00:00:31.602
Each row shows the medicine, the dosage, the status, the period, the reason,

3.3
00:00:31.602 --> 00:00:36.757
the notes, and who logged it. Select See Note to read a note.

4.1
00:00:36.757 --> 00:00:38.900
Step 4. Show more statements.

4.2
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.555
Select Load More to add the next statements to the list.

4.3
00:00:42.555 --> 00:00:47.428
Care shows the button only while there are more statements to load.
